{"id": 17296, "title": "Hometown", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "hometown", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/17296_hometown.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我有一个朋友，他的家乡不是这个城市。他经常说，他的家乡和这个城市很不一样。我以为他会不开心，因为家人都不在这儿。但是他告诉我，无论在哪儿，只要有好邻居、好朋友，就像在家一样。他也经常说家乡话，我觉得太有趣了，我一定要学几句。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我有一個朋友，他的家鄉不是這個城市。他經常說，他的家鄉和這個城市很不一樣。我以為他會不開心，因為家人都不在這兒。但是他告訴我，無論在哪兒，只要有好鄰居、好朋友，就像在家一樣。他也經常說家鄉話，我覺得太有趣了，我一定要學幾句。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ yǒu yī gè péng you， tā de jiā xiāng bù shì zhè gè chéng shì。 tā jīng cháng shuō， tā de jiā xiāng hé zhè gè chéng shì hěn bù yī yàng。 wǒ yǐ wéi tā huì bù kāi xīn， yīn wèi jiā rén dōu bù zài zhè r。 dàn shì tā gào su wǒ， wú lùn zài nǎ r， zhǐ yào yǒu hǎo lín jū、 hǎo péng you， jiù xiàng zài jiā yī yàng。 tā yě jīng cháng shuō jiā xiāng huà， wǒ jué de tài yǒu qù le， wǒ yī dìng yào xué jǐ jù。"], "english_paragraphs": ["I have a friend whose hometown is not this city. He often said that his hometown is very different from this city. I thought he would be unhappy because his family was not here. But he told me that no matter where I am, as long as I have good neighbors and good friends, I feel like I am at home. He also often speaks his hometown dialect, which I find so interesting that I must learn a few words."], "english_full": "I have a friend whose hometown is not this city. He often said that his hometown is very different from this city. I thought he would be unhappy because his family was not here. But he told me that no matter where I am, as long as I have good neighbors and good friends, I feel like I am at home. He also often speaks his hometown dialect, which I find so interesting that I must learn a few words.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><spa